  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 202.02 “Appellant” means the person who initiates an appeal by filing a notice of appeal in accordance with Env-WMC 204.\n\nSource. #4846, eff 6-21-90, EXPIRED: 6-21-96\n\nNew. #6334, eff 9-20-96; ss by #8031, eff 1-24-04",
